### 设置 ADMIN_JWT_SECRET（至少32字节随机密钥的Base64）、ADMIN_RBAC_PASSWORD 后启动 AdminApplication。
### 仅使用 security-jwt。业务校验账号密码后，以 userId 登录；不要在请求中自行传 userId。
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8083
@adminPassword = replace-with-your-admin-password

### 1. 管理员登录，保存 Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin","password":"{{adminPassword}}","deviceType":"web"}

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.data.token); %}

### 2. 当前用户（角色编码和合并后的权限集合）
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3. 创建只读角色，权限编码直接保存在集合中
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/roles/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{"code":"reader","name":"只读人员","permissions":["user:query"]}

> {% client.global.set("readerRoleId", response.body.data); %}

### 3a. 角色分页，支持编码等值、名称 LIKE 和白名单排序
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/roles/page
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{"pageNumber":1,"pageSize":15,"name":"只读","orderList":[{"name":"code","asc":true}]}

### 3b. 角色详情
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/roles/detail
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{"id":"{{readerRoleId}}"}

### 4. 创建用户，角色编码直接保存在集合中
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/users/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{"username":"reader01","password":"Example-Password-2026","nickname":"只读示例","roleCodes":["reader"]}

> {% client.global.set("readerUserId", response.body.data); %}

### 4a. 用户列表（当前页、脱敏，最多100条）
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/users/list
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{"pageNumber":1,"pageSize":15,"username":"reader"}

### 4b. 用户详情
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/users/detail
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{"id":"{{readerUserId}}"}

### 5. 枚举状态过滤与分页排序
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/users/page
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{"pageNumber":1,"pageSize":15,"username":"reader","status":"enabled","orderList":[{"name":"crtTime","asc":false}]}

### 6. 普通用户登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"reader01","password":"Example-Password-2026","deviceType":"web"}

> {% client.global.set("readerToken", response.body.data.token); %}

### 7. 只读用户可以查询用户
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/users/page
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}

{"pageNumber":1,"pageSize":15}

### 8. 没有 role:query，应返回 HTTP 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/roles/list
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}

### 9. 管理员修改角色权限，事务提交后下一次请求通过 UserStore 读取最新权限
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/roles/update
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{"id":"{{readerRoleId}}","name":"只读人员","permissions":["user:query","role:query"]}

### 10. 原 Token 无需重新登录，现在可以查询角色
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/roles/list
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}

### 11. 替换用户的角色集合；[] 表示移除全部角色
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/users/roles
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{"id":"{{readerUserId}}","roleCodes":[]}

### 12. 当前 Token 仍然有效，但角色和权限为空
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}

### 13. 停用用户，提交后 UserStore 拒绝后续请求（不是撤销 JWT）
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/users/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{"id":"{{readerUserId}}","status":"disabled"}

### 14. 用户已停用，应返回 HTTP 401；若重新启用，未过期 JWT 可以继续使用
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}

### 14a. 重新启用账号（无状态 JWT 未被撤销）
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/users/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{"id":"{{readerUserId}}","status":"enabled"}

### 14b. 未过期的原 JWT 又能访问，验证停用不是永久撤销
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}

### 15. 重置密码（纯无状态 JWT 不会因改密失效）
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/users/password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{"id":"{{readerUserId}}","password":"Another-Password-2026"}

### 15a. 修改密码后，未过期的原 JWT 仍能访问
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{readerToken}}

### 16. 删除角色，同时移除用户集合内的对应编码
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/roles/delete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{"id":"{{readerRoleId}}"}

### 17. 主动刷新用户资料，不延长 Token 过期时间
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/auth/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 18. 批量创建角色，返回ID顺序与items一致
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/roles/createBatch
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{"items":[{"code":"example-editor","name":"编辑示例","permissions":["user:query"]},{"code":"example-auditor","name":"审核示例","permissions":["role:query"]}]}

> {% client.global.set("batchRoleId1", response.body.data[0]); client.global.set("batchRoleId2", response.body.data[1]); %}

### 19. 批量修改角色，事务提交后下一请求加载最新权限
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/roles/updateBatch
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{"items":[{"id":"{{batchRoleId1}}","name":"编辑示例-新名称","permissions":["user:query","role:query"]},{"id":"{{batchRoleId2}}","name":"审核示例-新名称","permissions":["role:query"]}]}

### 20. 批量创建用户，仍用明文请求密码，由服务端生成密码哈希（实际部署必须使用HTTPS）
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/users/createBatch
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{"items":[{"username":"batch01","password":"Example-Password-2026","nickname":"批量用户1","roleCodes":["example-editor"]},{"username":"batch02","password":"Example-Password-2026","nickname":"批量用户2","roleCodes":["example-auditor"]}]}

> {% client.global.set("batchUserId1", response.body.data[0]); client.global.set("batchUserId2", response.body.data[1]); %}

### 21. 批量修改用户昵称，不允许借此修改角色、状态或密码
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/users/updateBatch
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{"items":[{"id":"{{batchUserId1}}","nickname":"批量用户1-新昵称"},{"id":"{{batchUserId2}}","nickname":"批量用户2-新昵称"}]}

### 22. 批量删除用户，不能包含当前登录账号
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/users/deleteBatch
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{"ids":["{{batchUserId1}}","{{batchUserId2}}"]}

### 23. 批量删除角色，同样不能包含内置admin角色
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/roles/deleteBatch
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{"ids":["{{batchRoleId1}}","{{batchRoleId2}}"]}

### 24. 注销：只清理当前线程，客户端删除 Token；不会撤销 JWT
POST {{baseUrl}}/rbac/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

> {% client.global.clear("adminToken"); %}
